{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"252640","tmdb_id":"movie/252640","media_type":"movie","title":"藏海传","original_title":"藏海传","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnYzQyA5Rh1b5nOnlo0Sh8yCFYr.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SLimeCtDZhk9CCKj4qr435yvPT.jpg","overview":"大雍国钦天监监正蒯铎（钟汉良 饰）之子稚奴（肖战 饰），因父亲拒绝交出一件神秘之物，惨遭平津侯庄芦隐（黄觉 饰）灭门。被困火海的稚奴被父亲的一位戴面具的旧友救走，随后被安排改换容貌、化名“藏海”。\n\n　　十年间，藏海师从三位大师，精研营造技艺与纵横之术。学成后，他重返京城，以谋士身份潜入仇人庄芦隐府中。凭借过人智谋，他拉拢平津侯二公子庄之行（周奇 饰），设计离间仇人势力，逐步揭开父母惨死的真相。在复仇途中，藏海与多年前的旧友——枕楼老板、冬夏郡主香暗荼（张婧仪 饰）等人重逢，众人因各自的身世与目标，最终不约而同地汇聚于同一条复仇之路。\n\n　　藏海从一介布衣谋士逐步迈向朝堂，最终不仅手刃仇敌，更揭破了一场关乎家国天下的巨大阴谋。在完成个人复仇的同时，他携手挚爱与朋友，共同守护国家。","release_date":"2025-05-18","first_air_date":"2025-05-18","year":"2025","runtime":"","episode_run_time":"45","number_of_episodes":40,"number_of_seasons":1,"genres":["剧情"],"languages":["普通话"],"countries":["China"],"tmdb_rating":"7.0 / 10 from 73 users","tmdb_rating_average":7.041,"tmdb_votes":73,"imdb_id":"tt32514856","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt32514856/","imdb_rating":"8.2 / 10 from 23798 users","imdb_rating_average":"8.2","imdb_votes":"23798","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1399721,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"郑晓龙","original_name":"郑晓龙","popularity":1.5792,"profile_path":"/uHbeVpe6Z08SxtkV3Dp1XjCCM76.jpg","credit_id":"66b12be7440b540ee191124b","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":5517697,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Cao Yiwen","original_name":"Cao Yiwen","popularity":0.0132,"profile_path":"/6ay5R94t0KmhlC4u6h1b3lE44aJ.jpg","credit_id":"6855994ae96cd1701d7753c0","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1399721,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"郑晓龙","original_name":"郑晓龙","popularity":1.5792,"profile_path":"/uHbeVpe6Z08SxtkV3Dp1XjCCM76.jpg","credit_id":"66b12c246ce8daa52f2f4a8a","department":"Production","job":"Producer"}],"writers":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":4868861,"known_for_department